{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:50:52+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:50:52+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"MTU Aero Engines AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"Germany","city":"Munich","website":"https://www.mtu.de","employees":14085,"summary":"MTU Aero Engines AG, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the development, manufacture, sale, and maintenance of commercial and military aircraft engines, and aero-derivative industrial gas turbines in Germany, other European countries, North America, Asia, and internationally. It operates through two segments: Original Equipment Manufacturing Business; and Maintenance, Repair, and Overhaul Business. The company offers commercial aircraft engines for wide body aircraft, narrow body, regional jets, helicopters, business jets, and turboprops; military aircraft engines for fighter jets, helicopters, and transporters; and industrial gas turbines. It also maintains, repairs, and overhauls commercial and military engines; and manufactures and markets various spare parts. The company was formerly known as MTU Aero Engines Holding AG and changed its name to MTU Aero Engines AG in May 2013. MTU Aero Engines AG was founded in 1913 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"MTU Aero Engines AG, avec ses filiales, se consacre au développement, à la fabrication, à la vente et à la maintenance de moteurs d'avions commerciaux et militaires et de turbines à gaz industrielles aéro-dérivées en Allemagne, dans d'autres pays européens, en Amérique du Nord, en Asie et à l'international. Elle exerce ses activités dans deux secteurs : la fabrication d'équipement d'origine et les activités de maintenance, de réparation et de révision. La société propose des moteurs d'avions commerciaux pour les avions à fuselage large, les avions à fuselage étroit, les jets régionaux, les hélicoptères, les avions d'affaires et les turbopropulseurs; des moteurs d'avions militaires pour les avions de chasse, les hélicoptères et les transporteurs; et des turbines à gaz industrielles."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":17992785920,"shares_outstanding":53870614,"trailing_pe":19.228554,"forward_pe":16.149557,"price_to_book":3.960537,"ev_to_ebitda":12.765,"ev_to_revenue":1.946,"dividend_yield":0.0109,"payout_ratio":0.1275,"beta_yahoo":0.875},"targets":{"current_price":334.0,"mean":415.85,"median":422.5,"high":530.0,"low":320.0,"n_analysts":20,"reco_mean":2.35,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-29"],"eps_avg":4.93038,"eps_low":4.47186,"eps_high":5.23,"revenue_avg":2699132320,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-08","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.0,"institutions_pct":0.69742996,"institutions_float_pct":0.69742996,"institutions_n":499,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":536,"value":179024,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.1237}],"funds":[{"name":"AMERICAN FUNDS INSURANCE SERIES-Eupac Fund","pct":0.021300001,"shares":1148123,"value":383473082,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":16.2443},{"name":"Capital World Growth & Income Fund","pct":0.016,"shares":859974,"value":287231316,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":1.18},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0148,"shares":794726,"value":265438484,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0087},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0098,"shares":527982,"value":176345988,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0139},{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST I-MFS Research International Fund","pct":0.0087,"shares":466383,"value":155771922,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":-0.0404},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0076,"shares":409269,"value":136695846,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0154},{"name":"MFS Series Trust XVII-MFS International Equity Fund","pct":0.0074,"shares